可复算数值例"}]},"generated":{"artifact_digest":"sha256:df398fb56393db595a2c4afeed26aa135f0bbe51debba088e249533325fcf953","generated_at":"2026-09-06T00:00:00Z","model":"lecture-grounded-v2","prompt_version":"teaching-artifact-v1","provider":"math-explanation-sample","raw_reply_digest":"sha256:c324a3023c8f4580f6160babda59816419c46489c8476eae80256c9fc18cbd97","source_hash":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6"},"revision":9,"schema_version":1,"source":{"excerpt":"##### 两种定义等价性的证明\n\n以下展开完整的余弦定理推导过程。\n\n证明：设 $a = (a_{1}, a_{2})$，$b = (b_{1}, b_{2})$，其夹角为 $\\theta$。\n\n考虑向量 $a - b$。由余弦定理（或三角形不等式），在三角形 OAB 中：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta \\dots ①\n$$\n\n另一方面，用代数展开左边：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = (a_{1}-b_{1})^{2} + (a_{2}-b_{2})^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= a_{1}^{2} - 2a_{1}b_{1} + b_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2} - 2a_{2}b_{2} + b_{2}^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= (a_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2}) + (b_{1}^{2} + b_{2}^{2}) - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n$$\n= |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}) \\dots ②\n$$\n\n对比 ① 和 ②：\n$$\n|a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n消去 $|a|^{2} + |b|^{2}$，两边同除以 $-2$，得：\n$$\n|a||b|\\cos\\theta = a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}\n$$\n即 几何定义 $=$ 代数定义。■\n\n推广：对 $R^{n}$，$n \\geq 3$，我们无法画出夹角 $\\theta$，但可以直接用代数定义 $a \\cdot b = \\sum a_{i}b_{i}$，然后用 Cauchy-Schwarz 不等式保证 $|a \\cdot b|/(|a||b|) \\in [-1,1]$，从而定义 $\\theta = \\arccos(\\frac{a \\cdot b}{|a||b|})$。这就是第1章末尾高维预览的核心逻辑。","heading_level":5,"heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"neighboring_titles":[],"occurrence":1,"source_hash":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","source_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"spans":[{"end_line":291,"fingerprint":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"id":"第1章 向量与几何测量 / 1.3 内积 / 两种定义等价性的证明::1::sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","start_line":255,"text":"##### 两种定义等价性的证明\n\n以下展开完整的余弦定理推导过程。\n\n证明：设 $a = (a_{1}, a_{2})$，$b = (b_{1}, b_{2})$，其夹角为 $\\theta$。\n\n考虑向量 $a - b$。由余弦定理（或三角形不等式），在三角形 OAB 中：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta \\dots ①\n$$\n\n另一方面，用代数展开左边：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = (a_{1}-b_{1})^{2} + (a_{2}-b_{2})^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= a_{1}^{2} - 2a_{1}b_{1} + b_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2} - 2a_{2}b_{2} + b_{2}^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= (a_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2}) + (b_{1}^{2} + b_{2}^{2}) - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n$$\n= |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}) \\dots ②\n$$\n\n对比 ① 和 ②：\n$$\n|a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n消去 $|a|^{2} + |b|^{2}$，两边同除以 $-2$，得：\n$$\n|a||b|\\cos\\theta = a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}\n$$\n即 几何定义 $=$ 代数定义。■\n\n推广：对 $R^{n}$，$n \\geq 3$，我们无法画出夹角 $\\theta$，但可以直接用代数定义 $a \\cdot b = \\sum a_{i}b_{i}$，然后用 Cauchy-Schwarz 不等式保证 $|a \\cdot b|/(|a||b|) \\in [-1,1]$，从而定义 $\\theta = \\arccos(\\frac{a \\cdot b}{|a||b|})$。这就是第1章末尾高维预览的核心逻辑。"}]},"status":"published","teaching_profile":{"minimum_level":3,"required_sections":["definition","formula","derivation","worked_examples","geometric_meaning","pitfalls"],"requires_analogy_boundary":false},"topic_id":"ch01.inner.equivalence","visual_semantics":{"entities":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"a","kind":"vector","label":"a","role":"vector_a","value":[1,2]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"b","kind":"vector","label":"b","role":"vector_b","value":[3,4]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"difference","kind":"vector","label":"a-b","role":"transformed_a","value":[-2,-2]}],"relations":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"rel.0.claim.ch01.inner.equivalence","kind":"compare","parameters":{},"source_ref":"a","target_ref":"b"}],"scene_kind":"2d","stages":[{"caption":"先读对象、角色和输入输出。","expected_invariants":["两种定义在固定欧氏内积下恒等；交换 a、b 数值不变。"],"id":"stage.